 "remarks": "Cozy and clean expanded Cape located in the heart of Stamford. Convenient location is within walking distance to shopping, restaurants and grocery stores. Main level offers large living room with fireplace and bay window, kitchen and dining room plus large bedroom and full bath. Off the kitchen, the 3 season screened porch opens onto level private yard, perfect for outdoor parties and entertaining. Upper level has 3 additional large bedrooms with a half bath, which can be easily be converted to a full bath (the existing plumbing lines are currently walled off). The full basement provides a laundry room, plenty of storage, and easy outdoor access. Driveway gives ample parking with additional street parking on this quiet cul de sac. Super-accessible downtown-adjacent property on the bus line, sits just 1.5 miles from Mill River Park and its amenities, and 2 miles to the train station.",
